  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="Tag839" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;!--?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="no"?--&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class="Section_1"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;1.&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;General&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-style: italic;"&gt;Organization&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;We are a Delaware limited liability company, formed on March 1, 2007. When we refer to "us," "we," "our," "the Company," or "MEP" we are describing Midcontinent Express Pipeline LLC.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The Members' interests in MEP are as follows:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style="margin-top: 14pt; margin-left: 36pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 18pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Symbol; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&amp;#61623;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;50% - Kinder Morgan Operating LLC "A", an indirect subsidiary of Kinder Morgan, Inc.; and&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style="margin-top: 14pt; margin-left: 36pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 18pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Symbol; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&amp;#61623;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;50% - ETC Midcontinent Express L.L.C., a subsidiary of Energy Transfer Partners, L.P.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-style: italic; -aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-style: italic;"&gt;Basis of Presentation&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;We have prepared our accompanying financial statements in accordance with the accounting requirements of the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission as set forth in its applicable Uniform System of Accounts and published accounting releases, which is a comprehensive basis of accounting other than accounting principles generally accepted in the United States of America. In management&amp;#8217;s opinion, these financial statements reflect normal and recurring adjustments that are necessary for a fair presentation of our financial results for the interim periods presented, and adequate disclosures have been made to make the information presented not misleading. These interim financial statements should be read along with the financial statements and related notes included in our 2025 Annual Report of Major Natural Gas Companies on Form No. 2.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Management has evaluated subsequent events through May 29, 2026, the date the financial statements were available to be issued.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style="margin-top: 14pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 18.35pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: -18.35pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;2.&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Related Party Transactions &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-style: italic;"&gt;Proprietary Capital&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
