            <xhtml:p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: normal; font-size: 18pt;">
              <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;">Line 3 represents cashout purchases recorded in Account 803.</xhtml:span>
            </xhtml:p>
