              <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;">Recorded pursuant to Docket No. AI93-5-000 issued on April 23, 1993 (Accounting for Income Taxes).</xhtml:span>
            </xhtml:p>
